        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Steel or Aluminum Frame Entry Door Mortise Deadbolt Lock Sets</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nHuge five-ply laminated steel bolt with concealed hardened steel pin provides maximum security. Designed for aluminum or steel framed storefront entry doors.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications:</b> \r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Backset: Optional 31/32\", 1-1/8\" or 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Non handed, easily reversible</li>\r\n<li>Face Plate: Width - 1\", Length - 6-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Case Dimensions: Width - 7/8\",  Length -  6\", Depth (specific to backset) - 1.63\" through 1.78\"</li>\r\n<li>Deadbolt: Width - 5/8\", Throw - 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/TH1101.pdf?v=1704262220\" target=\"new\"\"><b>Mortise Deadbolt Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis complete mortise deadbolt set with zinc cylinder is available in <b>Single Cylinder</b> (keyed lock outside with thumbturn inside) or <b>Double Cylinder</b> (keyed lock on both the outside and inside). \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p> \r\n<b>GLO-TH1101-PZSC</b> - Zinc Single Cylinder Mortise Deadbolt Set:\r\n<li><a href=\"/products/1-inch-zinc-mortise-cylinder-lock-th1100-zc\">Zinc Cylinder Lock</a></li> \r\n<li><a href=\"/products/storefront-door-mortise-cylinder-zinc-thumbturn-th1100-zt\">Zinc Thumbturn</a></li> \r\n<li>Pair of 3/16\" Spacer/Trim Rings</li> \r\n<li><a href=\"/products/storefront-door-mortise-lock-deadbolt-body-th1101\">Mortise Deadbolt Body</a></li> \r\n<li><a href=\"/products/mortise-deadbolt-faceplate-th1100-fp1-5\">Flat Face Plate</a></li>\r\n<li>Includes cylinder set screws, trim, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n</p> \r\n\r\n<p> \r\n<b>GLO-TH1101-PZDC:</b> - Zinc Double Cylinder Mortise Deadbolt Set \r\n<li><a href=\"/products/1-inch-zinc-mortise-cylinder-lock-th1100-zc\">Pair of Zinc Cylinder Locks (keyed alike)</a></li> \r\n<li>Pair of 3/16\" Spacer/Trim Rings</li> \r\n<li><a href=\"/products/storefront-door-mortise-lock-deadbolt-body-th1101\">Mortise Deadbolt Body</a></li> \r\n<li><a href=\"/products/mortise-deadbolt-faceplate-th1100-fp1-5\">Flat Face Plate</a></li>\r\n<li>Includes cylinder set screws, trim, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n</p> \r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAvailable in Aluminum or Dark Bronze finish for cylinders and trim. When ordering more than 1 set, you can have them Keyed Differently or Keyed Alike (same key for all sets).\r\n</p>",
